    "protocols": {
      "sse/streamableHttp": "true. the attached controller (packages/gozar-node/attached-route.mjs, runAttachedController) forwards the SDK listener to a gate it runs in front of the app. Before it reports a published origin it runs the same timed-SSE validation as recipe routes (gate.verify with sse) through the public origin. Frames must arrive unbuffered and in order, or the listener is closed and the route fails with verification_failed. Red test: test/adapters/ngrok-attached-validation.test.mjs",
      "oauthDcr": "oauthDcr: the reserved domain is a stable HTTPS origin and the configured authority is preserved."
    }
